# mobile/chakraos is a separate, unrelated Expo/React Native app that lives
# in this repo (see mobile/chakraos/README.md). Its own package.json and
# lockfile made Vercel auto-detect this repo as a monorepo and fail the
# deployment for the actual Next.js site — exclude it from the deployment
# entirely so Vercel only ever sees the single Next.js project at the root.
mobile/
